  "description": "GStreamer is a streaming media framework, based on graphs of elements which operate on media data. This package contains plug-ins whose license is not fully compatible with LGPL.  \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * gstreamer: gstreamer1-plugins-ugly-free: gstreamer: integer overflow/underflow in asfdemux bounds checks leading to out-of-bounds read (CVE-2026-19389)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n",
